WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.280
Repeat after me.

00:00:01.700 --> 00:00:03.380
I promise to love you for the rest of my life.

00:00:04.380 --> 00:00:06.480
I promise to cherish every moment we share.

00:00:07.180 --> 00:00:07.920
Oh, what the?

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:08.680
What the cat?

00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:09.780
Wait, hey, it has the hair.
